#: ../../chapter7.rst:3
msgid "Folder Legends in Web Interface"
msgstr "Mappelegender i webgrænsefladen"

#: ../../chapter7.rst:5
msgid "There are many different folders in the web interface."
msgstr "Der er mange forskellige mapper i webgrænsefladen."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:7
msgid "Here is a list of them."
msgstr "Her er en liste over dem."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:9
msgid "**Mounted Storage**"
msgstr "**Monteret Lagerplads**"

#: ../../chapter7.rst:15
msgid ""
"This folder represents mounted/attached storage. For example, a mounted "
"file server network share or a connected Amazon S3 bucket will look like "
"this."
msgstr "Denne mappe repræsenterer monteret/tilkoblet lagring. For eksempel vil et monteret netværksdrev fra en filserver eller en tilsluttet Amazon S3-spand se sådan ud."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:17
msgid "**Sync From Remote**"
msgstr "**Synkroniser Fra Fjern**"

#: ../../chapter7.rst:23
msgid ""
"This folder represents synchronization folders from remote PCs or Server "
"Agents."
msgstr "Denne mappe repræsenterer synkroniseringsmapper fra fjerne pc'er eller Serveragenter."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:25
msgid "**Received Shares**"
msgstr "**Modtagne delinger**"

#: ../../chapter7.rst:31
msgid ""
"This folder represents the root folder of all the shared files and "
"folders from other users."
msgstr "Denne mappe repræsenterer rodmappen for alle de delte filer og mapper fra andre brugere."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:33
msgid "**Regular Folder**"
msgstr "**Almindelig mappe**"

#: ../../chapter7.rst:39
msgid "This folder represents a single shared folder received from other users."
msgstr "Denne mappe repræsenterer en enkelt delt mappe modtaget fra andre brugere."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:41
msgid "**Team Folder**"
msgstr "**Teammappe**"

#: ../../chapter7.rst:47
msgid ""
"This folder represent a team folder that is published to users and viewed"
" from the users who received the team folder."
msgstr "Denne mappe repræsenterer en teammappe, der er offentliggjort til brugere og set fra de brugere, der har modtaget teammappen."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:49
msgid "**Version Control**"
msgstr "**Versionskontrol**"

#: ../../chapter7.rst:55
msgid ""
"Version folder represents folders that every files inside is under "
"version control."
msgstr "Versionsmappe repræsenterer mapper, hvor hver fil indeni er under versionskontrol."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:59
msgid ""
"If a folder doesn't have the version folder icon, doesn't mean it is not "
"a version folder."
msgstr "Hvis en mappe ikke har versionsmappeikonet, betyder det ikke, at det ikke er en versionsmappe."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:61
msgid ""
"As long as one of the parent folder is a version folder, everything "
"inside is under version control."
msgstr "Så længe en af overmapperne er en versionsmappe, er alt indeni under versionskontrol."

#: ../../chapter7.rst:63
msgid ""
"If the administrator setup the user as version control from the root, the"
" team user may not see the version folder icon either when version "
"control is on by default."
msgstr "Hvis administratoren konfigurerer brugeren som versionskontrol fra roden, kan teambrugeren muligvis heller ikke se versionsmappens ikon, når versionskontrol er aktiveret som standard."

